<section class="cp-topic" id="methodology-changelog">
<h2>Methodology changelog</h2>
<p>Each profile shows its methodology version ("Version <em>N</em>") on its About this data slide. The version is a monotonic integer, not a date: it increments only when a pipeline change could move a figure while the underlying source data stays the same (switching the intersect method, changing the rollup geography, fixing an aggregation bug), never for a new section, a restyle or an added county. Two snapshots carrying different versions are never joined by a trend line.</p>
